{"unit_id":"nickhelion__dsh-serverchan-notify#card-zh","repo":"nickhelion/dsh-serverchan-notify","commit":"1effe16e30cda0617e92a66ba0d698451d8a5266","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-serverchan-notify 是一款适用于 DSH 的通知集成插件，在顶层会话的回答回合结束后向 Server酱3 发送微信推送。它订阅 session/event 并筛选 turn/end 事件，可按结束原因过滤，也可选择是否包含子代理会话。通知包含标题、模型、项目目录、Git 分支、回合状态、时间、会话 ID 和最新回复，过长回复会截断。适合希望及时获知 DSH 任务完成或异常状态的用户；需要 Server酱3 SendKey 和网络连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:191-220","lib/index.js:137-181"]}
{"unit_id":"nickhelion__dsh-serverchan-notify#card-en","repo":"nickhelion/dsh-serverchan-notify","commit":"1effe16e30cda0617e92a66ba0d698451d8a5266","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-serverchan-notify sends ServerChan3 pushes to WeChat when a top-level DSH turn ends. It filters end reasons and can include subagent turns. Messages include session details and the latest reply, truncated when long. A ServerChan3 SendKey is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:191-220","lib/index.js:137-181"]}
