{"unit_id":"nickhelion__dsh-serverchan-notify#feature-reasons","repo":"nickhelion/dsh-serverchan-notify","commit":"1effe16e30cda0617e92a66ba0d698451d8a5266","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-serverchan-notify 的功能「回合结束推送」：监听 DSH 回合结束事件，并在完成、阻塞、出错、超限或中止时发送通知；interrupted 默认忽略。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:22-25"]}
{"unit_id":"nickhelion__dsh-serverchan-notify#feature-summary","repo":"nickhelion/dsh-serverchan-notify","commit":"1effe16e30cda0617e92a66ba0d698451d8a5266","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-serverchan-notify 的功能「回合摘要」：推送内容汇总对话标题、模型、项目目录、Git 分支、结束状态、会话 ID 和最新回复；回复超过配置长度时截断。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:137-161"]}
