{"unit_id":"nickhelion__dsh-serverchan-notify#feature-subagents","repo":"nickhelion/dsh-serverchan-notify","commit":"1effe16e30cda0617e92a66ba0d698451d8a5266","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-serverchan-notify 的功能「子代理通知开关」：默认跳过子代理会话；将 notifySubagents 设为 true 后，子代理回合结束时也会推送。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:191-216"]}
{"unit_id":"nickhelion__dsh-serverchan-notify#caveat-1","repo":"nickhelion/dsh-serverchan-notify","commit":"1effe16e30cda0617e92a66ba0d698451d8a5266","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-serverchan-notify 使用前须知：回合通知会将对话标题、模型、目录、状态和最新回复发送到 Server酱3 推送服务；配置 SendKey 后才会启用推送。见 lib/index.js:61-79,137-170。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:61-79","lib/index.js:137-170"]}
